?meta	common/zoom_acc/acc_len	xps:sw_reg	desc_str	Accumulation\_length,\_in\_FPGA\_clock\_cycles.\_To\_specify\_an\_accumulation\_length\_as\_a\_number\_of\_spectra\_this\_register\_should\_be\_written\_with\_``number_of_spectra\_x\_frequency_channels_per_spectra``.\_Here\_the\_number\_of\_frequency\_channels\_per\_spectra\_is\_the\_number\_*output*\_by\_the\_correlation\_subsystem.\_Glitches\_may\_occur\_(resulting\_in\_the\_no\_new\_accumulations\_for\_a\_few\_seconds)\_if\_the\_value\_in\_this\_register\_is\_reduced\_without\_re-applying\_a\_sync\_to\_the\_correlation\_module.
